# Keep binary assets from EOL/diff munging across platforms
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.webp binary
# Generated SVGs are hashed into docs/images/.showcase.json; keep their bytes identical on every OS
*.svg text eol=lf
# Docs and the changelog stay LF: a CRLF commit rewrites every line and conflicts every branch (CHANGELOG Unreleased)
CHANGELOG.md text eol=lf
references/*.md text eol=lf
